        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-2814_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-2814_47409_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-02_46869_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Page 700 results are reflective of partial year activity.</p><p>The cost-of-service results have been updated to reflect the most current interpretation of the FERC methodology outlined in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-236_46870_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Schedule Page 102 Line No.:1</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Energy Transfer LP owns 67.50% LP interest in ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP. ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP is the sole owner of ET-S Permian Pipeline Company LLC.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt"> </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-242_46871_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Schedule Page 102 Line No.:2</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Energy Transfer LP owns 100% of ET-S Permian Holdings GP LLC. ET-S Permian Holdings GP LLC owns 100% Managing GP interest in ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP. ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP is the sole owner of ET-S Permian Pipeline Company LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-249_46872_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Schedule Page 102 Line No.:3</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Sunoco LP owns 100% of Sunoco Midstream Holdings LLC. </p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Sunoco Midstream Holdings LLC <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">owns 100% of </span></span>Sun Pipeline Holdings LLC. </p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Sun Pipeline Holdings LLC owns 100% Special GP interest in ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP. </p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP is the sole owner of ET-S Permian Pipeline Company LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-255_46873_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Schedule Page 102 Line No.:4</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt">Sunoco LP owns 32.50% LP interest in ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP. ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP is the sole owner of ET-S Permian Pipeline Company LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-267_47020_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Cash management program with ET-S Permian Holdings Company LP.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-745_47248_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Schedule Page 114 Line No.: 1 Column: c<br />In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly rebillings in the amount of $13 million are included in Account(s) 600.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2145_47061_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page 212 Line No.: 47 Column: g </p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Other Adjustment includes $13,049,644 of prior year merger true-ups.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2347_47062_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page 216 Line No.: 47 Column: e</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Other Adjustments of $1,849,366 reflect an asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Also, including o<span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">ther credit Adjustments of $(935,531) reflect PY merger transactions.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2432_47021_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 18.4px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 18.4px">Please see the table below for the range of depreciation rates for each asset group.</span></p><div style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><table cellspacing="0" style="width: 256.25pt" class="e-rte-paste-table"><tr style="height: 20px"><td style="vertical-align: bottom; border: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; width: 253.333px"><p style="text-align: left; line-height: normal; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><span lang="en-US" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">102 Right of way</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: bottom; border: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; width: 88.3333px"><p style="text-align: left; line-height: normal; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><span lang="en-US" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">2.01 - 2.7</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 20px"><td style="vertical-align: bottom; border: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; width: 253.333px"><p style="text-align: left; line-height: normal; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><span lang="en-US" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">103 Line pipe</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: bottom; border: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; width: 88.3333px"><p style="text-align: left; line-height: normal; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><span lang="en-US" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">2.32 - 3.5