        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2814_47409_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $8,136,666 are included in line 10, interstate operating revenue. These revenues represent a one-time event and are not representative of future revenues.</p><p><br />The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model. This model calculates cost of service (COS) using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC  61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings.</p></div></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>